msgid "Introductory examples"
msgstr "入门示例"

msgid ""
"This section explains some very simple calculations in order to help the new"
" user to understand how easy things can be."
msgstr "本节通过一些非常简单的计算示例，帮助新用户理解操作可以多么容易。"

msgid "Using the molpro command"
msgstr "使用 molpro 命令"

msgid ""
"Perform a simple SCF calculation for molecular hydrogen. The input is typed "
"in directly and the output is sent to the terminal:"
msgstr "对氢分子执行一个简单的 SCF 计算。输入直接键入，输出发送到终端："

msgid ""
"The same calculation, with the data taken from the file ``h2.inp``. The "
"output is sent to h2.out. On completion, the file ``h2.pun`` is returned to "
"the current directory and the file ``h2.wf`` to the directory ``$HOME/wfu`` "
"(this is the default):"
msgstr ""
"同样的计算，数据取自文件 ``h2.inp``\\ 。输出发送到 h2.out。完成后，文件 ``h2.pun`` 返回到当前目录，文件 "
"``h2.wf`` 返回到目录 ``$HOME/wfu``\\ （这是默认设置）："

msgid "h2.inp contains:"
msgstr "h2.inp 包含："

msgid ""
"As before, but the file ``h2.wf`` is sent to the directory ``/tmp/wfu``:"
msgstr "如前所述，但文件 ``h2.wf`` 被发送到目录 ``/tmp/wfu``\\ ："

msgid "Simple SCF calculations"
msgstr "简单的 SCF 计算"

msgid ""
"The first example does an SCF calculation for H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O, using all "
"possible defaults."
msgstr "第一个示例对 H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O 进行 SCF 计算，使用了所有可能的默认设置。"

msgid "Geometry optimizations"
msgstr "几何优化"

msgid ""
"Now we can also do a geometry optimization, simply by adding the card "
"``OPTG``."
msgstr "现在，我们也可以通过简单地添加卡片 ``OPTG`` 来进行几何优化。"

msgid "CCSD(T)"
msgstr "CCSD(T)"

msgid ""
"The following job does a CCSD(T) calculation using a larger (``VTZ``) basis "
"(this includes an :math:`f` function on oxygen and a :math:`d` function on "
"the hydrogens)."
msgstr ""
"以下作业使用更大的（\\ ``VTZ``\\ ）基组进行 CCSD(T) 计算（这包括氧上的 :math:`f` 函数和氢上的 :math:`d` "
"函数）。"

msgid "Alternatively, the input could be written as"
msgstr "或者，输入也可以写成"

msgid "or, even shorter:"
msgstr "或者，更简短地："

msgid "CASSCF and MRCI"
msgstr "CASSCF 和 MRCI"

msgid ""
"Perhaps you want to do a CASSCF and subsequent MRCI for comparison. The "
"following uses the full valence active space in the CASSCF and MRCI "
"reference function."
msgstr "或许您想进行CASSCF及随后的MRCI计算以作比较。以下示例在CASSCF和MRCI参考函数中使用了全价层活性空间。"

msgid "Simplified input"
msgstr "简化输入"

msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表格"

msgid ""
"You may now want to print a summary of all results in a table. To do so, you"
" must store the computed energies in variables:"
msgstr "现在您可能希望将所有结果汇总打印在表格中。为此，您必须将计算出的能量存储在变量中："

msgid "This job produces the following table:"
msgstr "此作业生成以下表格："

msgid "Procedures"
msgstr "过程"

msgid "The job produces the same table as before."
msgstr "该任务产生与之前相同的表格。"

msgid ""
"For more details about procedures and further examples see `Procedures "
"section of Program control <program_control.html#procedures-proc-"
"endproc>`__."
msgstr ""
"有关过程的更多细节和进一步示例，请参阅 `程序控制中的过程部分 "
"<program_control.html#proceduresprocendproc>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Do loops"
msgstr "DO 循环"

msgid ""
"Now you have the idea that one geometry is not enough. Why not compute the "
"whole surface? ``DO`` loops make it easy. Here is an example, which computes"
" a whole potential energy surface for :math:`\\rm H_2O`."
msgstr ""
"现在您应该明白，单一几何结构是不够的。何不计算整个势能面呢？\\ ``DO`` 循环让这变得简单。以下是一个计算 :math:`\\rm H_2O` "
"完整势能面的示例。"

msgid "This produces the following table."
msgstr "这将产生以下表格。"

msgid ""
"You can use also use ``DO`` loops to repeat your input for different "
"methods."
msgstr "您也可以使用 ``DO`` 循环来为不同的方法重复您的输入。"

msgid "This calculation produces the following table."
msgstr "该计算产生以下表格。"

msgid ""
"One can do even more fancy things, like, for instance, using macros, stored "
"as string variables, see `Macro definitions using string variables "
"<variables.html#macro-definitions-using-string-variables>`__."
msgstr ""
"还可以实现更复杂的操作，例如，使用存储为字符串变量的宏，请参阅 `使用字符串变量的宏定义 "
"<variables.html#macrodefinitionsusingstringvariables>`__\\ 。"
